WEBVTT

00:41:54.996 --> 00:42:00.454
available to ever would like to use it,
but to put some controls on its usage.

00:42:00.454 --> 00:42:01.829
And also, if we make a mistake,

00:42:01.829 --> 00:42:04.871
to be able to pull it back or change it
or tweak it or improve it or whatever.

00:42:05.496 --> 00:42:09.788
But we do want to put and this is
continued will continue to be true with

00:42:09.788 --> 00:42:12.454
appropriate restrictions and guardrails,

00:42:12.663 --> 00:42:16.579
very powerful technology in the hands
of people. I think that is fair.

00:42:16.579 --> 00:42:20.204
I think that will lead to the best results
for the society as a whole.

00:42:20.913 --> 00:42:24.163
And I think it will sort
of maximize benefit.

00:42:24.163 --> 00:42:27.579
But that's very different than sort of
shipping the whole model and saying, here,

00:42:27.579 --> 00:42:31.454
do whatever you want with it. We're
able to enforce rules on it.